<title>USA: General Signal Corp Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>General Signal Corp Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.78		    $0.41</p>
<p> Net			 39,000		   20,300</p>
<p> Revs		     546,700		  501,600</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	50,000		   49,300</p>
<p>		 Year</p>
<p> Shr primary		$2.68		    $0.73</p>
<p> Net			133,400		   36,100</p>
<p> Revs		   2,065,000		1,863,200</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	49,700		   49,200</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>Notes:</p>
<p>For Q4 1995, earnings were $28.4 million, or $0.58 per share, excluding $12.7 million, or $0.17 per share of transaction and consolidation charges related to the merger with Data Switch Corp.</p>
<p>The year 1995 represents additional anticipated losses booked in the second and third quarters related to the disposal of Leeds &amp; Northrup and Dynapower/Stratopower, which were accounted for as discontinued operations since the fourth quarter of 1994.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
</text>
